      "description": "Partial-record checkpoint beneath shared run feedback; interrupted and cancelled states remain explicitly labeled.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-checkpoint\"><h3>Interrupted trial checkpoint</h3><p>Case: dev-01 · Model: configured-model · Approach: rag · Repetition 1</p><p>Usage may be incomplete. This checkpoint is a partial record, not a completed answer.</p><details><summary>Recorded checkpoint trace</summary><p>No tool trace was saved before the interruption.</p></details></section>",
      "css": ".ds-checkpoint{font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink, #151713);margin:20px 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line, #dce0d7)}.ds-checkpoint h3{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 8px}.ds-checkpoint p{color:var(--muted, #62665e);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-checkpoint details{margin-top:14px}.ds-checkpoint summary{cursor:pointer;color:#414b35;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:700}.ds-checkpoint summary::marker{color:#65734e;font-size:.75rem}.ds-checkpoint summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus, #537e14);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shared Budget Strip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "budget-strip",
      "description": "Shared remaining, allocated and reserved budget; amber paused state, busy loading text, and explicit unavailable status reuse existing visual treatments. Example figures are illustrative runtime data.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-budget\" aria-label=\"Shared experiment budget\" aria-busy=\"false\"><div class=\"ds-budget-heading\"><h2>€30 experiment limit</h2><span class=\"ds-budget-badge\">New calls paused</span></div><dl class=\"ds-budget-values\"><div><dt>Remaining</dt><dd>€0.00</dd></div><div><dt>Allocated</dt><dd>€28.00</dd></div><div><dt>Reserved</dt><dd>€2.00</dd></div></dl><p class=\"ds-budget-note\">Shared across all providers. USD→EUR estimates include a safety buffer; unknown charges stay reserved.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-budget{font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink, #151713);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 28px;background:var(--surface, #f5f6f3);padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:28px}.ds-budget-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px}.ds-budget-heading h2{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0;margin:0}.ds-budget-values{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 24px;margin:0 0 0 auto;font-size:.8rem}.ds-budget-values>div{display:flex;gap:7px}.ds-budget-values dt{color:var(--muted, #62665e)}.ds-budget-values dd{margin:0;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-budget-note{width:100%;color:var(--muted, #62665e);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.ds-budget-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;min-height:23px;padding:3px 8px;line-height:1.3;font-size:.69rem;font-weight:700;border-radius:2px;background:#f6edd7;color:#7b5b16}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-budget{gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:24px}.ds-budget-values{width:100%;margin-left:0;gap:8px 18px;font-size:.75rem}.ds-budget-note{font-size:.71rem}.ds-budget-badge{font-size:.64rem;padding-left:6px;padding-right:6px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Language Switch",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Header DE/EN group; German default, persisted selection, explicit pressed state, and locale-aware content.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-language-canvas\"><div class=\"ds-language-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Sprache\"><button lang=\"de\" aria-label=\"Deutsch\" aria-pressed=\"true\">DE</button><button lang=\"en\" aria-label=\"English\" aria-pressed=\"false\">EN</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-language-canvas{background:#111;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end}.ds-language-switch{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;align-items:center;border:1px solid #555b4e;border-radius:2px}.ds-language-switch button{font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;min-width:40px;min-height:40px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#c5c8c0;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:color 160ms ease-out,background 160ms ease-out,border-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-language-switch button+button{border-left:1px solid #555b4e}.ds-language-switch button:hover{background:#29301f;color:#fff}.ds-language-switch button[aria-pressed='true']{background:#86bc25;color:#182108}.ds-language-switch button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#537e14);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-language-switch button{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Agent Harness Selector",
      "kind": "input",
      "description": "Run-level Direct/CrewAI select, independent of the five approaches; capability-disabled options, active-run locking, stable payload IDs, and legacy Direct fallback.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-harness\"><label for=\"ds-harness-select\">Agenten-Framework</label><select id=\"ds-harness-select\" aria-describedby=\"ds-harness-description\"><option value=\"direct\" selected>Direkter Agent</option><option value=\"crewai\" disabled>CrewAI — nicht verfügbar</option></select><p id=\"ds-harness-description\">Direkter Agent mit Werkzeugaufrufen.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-harness{font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#151713)}.ds-harness label{display:block;font-weight:700;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:1.5}.ds-harness select{font:inherit;font-size:.89rem;background:#fff;border:1px solid #9ba28f;border-radius:2px;color:var(--ink,#151713);min-height:45px;padding:10px 32px 10px 12px;width:100%;min-width:0;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-harness select:hover{border-color:#5e6a4c}.ds-harness select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#537e14);outline-offset:1px}.ds-harness select:disabled{border-color:#c9cec2;color:#70766a;background:#f5f6f2}.ds-harness p{margin:9px 0 0;color:var(--muted,#62665e);font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.7}@media(max-width:680px){.ds-harness label{font-size:.79rem;margin-bottom:7px}.ds-harness select{min-height:46px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Evidence Workspace",
    "overview": "The Evidence Workspace is a restrained, dense working interface: a black navigation band, a white canvas, muted fact regions, and green actions. Typography and fine dividers carry the hierarchy without decorative imagery or elevation.\n\nThe user requested Deloitte design. This record describes the provisional implementation evidenced by frontend/src/styles.css and frontend/src/App.tsx; exact conformance to design.deloitte.com remains unverified because that authority was inaccessible. Open Sans is intentionally retained for the requested brand direction.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Flat surfaces and fine structural dividers.",
      "Compact Open Sans hierarchy with prominent monetary figures.",
      "Green actions and explicitly labeled status tones.",
      "Inline evidence regions and responsive stacked workspaces."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Action Green Rule",
        "body": "Use bright green for primary actions and selected navigation; use dark green for readable links on light surfaces.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Numeric Clarity Rule",
        "body": "Use tabular numerals for money, result columns, and recorded usage.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Separate regions with tone, spacing, and fine borders rather than shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do retain the black header, white canvas, and muted fact-region hierarchy.",
      "Do pair status colors with readable labels.",
      "Do retain visible keyboard focus and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do stack regions at phone widths and let wide result tables scroll within their container."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't claim exact Deloitte design-system compliance from these provisional tokens.",
      "Don't use green status alone to communicate an outcome.",
      "Don't introduce decorative shadows into the flat workspace."
    ]
  }
}
